# OmniDown ignore rules
#
# Keep source, project files, manifests, resources, docs, and bundled runtime
# assets in Git. Ignore local IDE state, build output, logs, package artifacts,
# and publish secrets.

## Visual Studio / editor local state
.vs/
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
.localhistory/
.ionide/

## Build output and intermediate files
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
.build/
artifacts/
TestResults/
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/

## Compiler, linker, and build diagnostics
*.log
*.binlog
*.tlog
