*.iobj
*.pch
*.pdb
*.ipdb
*.ilk
*.idb
*.rsp
*.cache
*.cachefile
*.tmp
*.tmp_proj
*_wpftmp.csproj
Generated\ Files/
Generated_Code/
FakesAssemblies/
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

