## NuGet and dependency caches
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json

## Windows app packaging and publish output
AppPackages/
BundleArtifacts/
publish/
PublishScripts/
Package.StoreAssociation.xml
_pkginfo.txt
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.appxupload
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.msixupload

## Publish profiles
# Ignore personal/sensitive publish material. Track the checked-in platform
# profiles because OmniDown.csproj references win-$(Platform).pubxml.
*.publishsettings
*.azurePubxml
*.pubxml.user
*.pfx
*.pubxml
!OmniDown/Properties/PublishProfiles/
!OmniDown/Properties/PublishProfiles/win-*.pubxml

## Test and coverage output
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
OpenCover/
_NCrunch_*
.*crunch*.local.xml
nCrunchTemp_*

